# csv_pipeline.pal - LOCKED acceptance harness for the csv_lab `pipeline` driver end to end (extract -> batch -> translate -> lint -> repair only failed rows -> score with a different model -> merge, ledger, answer bank, UI feed). Test doubles only: no real model is contacted. Read results/csv_pipeline.txt.verdict.txt.
exec ./ops/+x/harness_case_op.+x cases/csv_pipeline.pdl
exec ./ops/+x/harness_verdict_op.+x cases/csv_pipeline.pdl
exec ./ops/+x/harness_bank_op.+x cases/csv_pipeline.pdl
halt
